{
 "_what": "Quick view of the Section 3.5 runs: values pulled from each run's <RUN>.run.json (args/models/ac_fields), stats summary (learning-rate schedule actually applied), final.summary.json (eval), ckpt adapter configs. Paths are relative to 05_ablations/.",
 "_notes": [
  "lr group order in stats learning_rates: [encoder(ac), reader]; lr_last_over_peak 0.1 = cosine to 0.1x.",
  "penalty_weight/penalty_fraction come from run.json; the trainer applies the penalty only when reader lr > 0 (excerpts/ac_model_training.penalty.excerpt.txt), so frozen-reader runs (*_v4fr, R_in_v4fre4) have an empty penalty log (stats penalty__len 0).",
  "eval max_new_tokens: AC arms 128 = sec45_eval.py --max-new default and job_template.sh line 155 (not recorded inside final.summary.json); greedy = completion_sampling None (excerpts/sec45_eval.excerpt.txt).",
  "write mode -> ac_fields: in = no layers, no kv; res = intervention_layers 3..35 step 4; kv = kv_transfer true.",
  "ac_modules.pt config default_compression_ratio is 0.0625 but every item is built with sec45_common.RATIO = 0.1 (excerpts/sec45_common.excerpt.txt lines 36,126,137); ttft extract sweep_phases ac_rows/side_tokens = 229.5/2288 confirms 0.1.",
  "R_in_v4fre4: two valid executions with identical args (node l copy in runs/R_in_v4fre4/, CSAIL copy in runs/R_in_v4fre4/csail_copy/); its task run T_in_v4fre4 was cancelled (~u400; only u0 eval) and no Fig. 7 panel reads either run (excerpts/make_sec45_v4.excerpt.txt)."
